1
00:00:00,667 --> 00:00:02,085
Thank you

2
00:00:02,211 --> 00:00:03,837
for staying there

3
00:00:04,880 --> 00:00:07,674
This is the signal
that I'm here

4
00:00:13,764 --> 00:00:14,932
Come this way!

5
00:00:15,057 --> 00:00:16,475
- Here!
- Lee Hyesung!

6
00:00:16,600 --> 00:00:17,976
- Here he is!
- Hyesung!

7
00:00:18,101 --> 00:00:19,101
This way

8
00:00:20,103 --> 00:00:21,103
Is he here?

9
00:00:25,734 --> 00:00:26,734
Oh my God

10
00:00:29,154 --> 00:00:30,154
Hyesung

11
00:00:31,281 --> 00:00:31,907
Are you okay?

12
00:00:32,032 --> 00:00:33,325
Didn't you get hurt?

13
00:00:33,450 --> 00:00:34,451
You must've been cold

14
00:00:34,576 --> 00:00:36,203
We found him
He was right here

15
00:00:36,328 --> 00:00:37,162
Are you okay?

16
00:00:37,287 --> 00:00:38,727
He's fine, just come
to the back side

17
00:00:55,639 --> 00:00:57,849
Excuse me for a moment

18
00:01:18,996 --> 00:01:20,622
Let's start shooting!

19
00:01:22,207 --> 00:01:23,207
Thank you
